:0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":1,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-sanguozhi-062-huzong","s-shiji-043-zhao"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-062-huzong:line026:m0042","surface":"農","start":42,"end":43,"kind":"person","person_id":"0rm_hvx_4a6","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本段具名及前後親稱、官職定位。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-062-huzong:line026","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-062-huzong"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m071-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"神農","kind":"person","person_id":"0rm_hvx_4a6","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p071","chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji043-182","person_id":"0rm_hvx_4a6","surfaces":["神農"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-043-zhao"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p071","quote":"趙文、趙造、周袑、趙俊皆諫止王毋胡服，如故法便。王曰：「先王不同俗，何古之法？帝王不相襲，何禮之循？虙戲、神農教而不誅，黃帝、堯、舜誅而不怒。及至三王，隨時制法，因事制禮。法度制令各順其宜，衣服器械各便其用。故禮也不必一道，而便國不必古。聖人之興也不相襲而王，夏、殷之衰也不易禮而滅。然則反古未可非，而循禮未足多也。且服奇者志淫，則是鄒、魯無奇行也；俗辟者民易，則是吳、越無秀士也。且聖人利身謂之服，便事謂之禮。夫進退之節，衣服之制者，所以齊常民也，非所以論賢者也。故齊民與俗流，賢者與變倶。故諺曰『以書御者不盡馬之情，以古制今者不達事之變』。循法之功，不足以髙世；法古之學，不足以制今。子不及也。」遂胡服招騎射。"}],"rationale":"限本篇人物、連續政治事件及明示生子是為敘事；武靈王／主父、王子何／惠文王及惠后吳娃按本文連接。公子章不與早期敬侯章合併，何不與較早趙何合併；髙信與信期、趙袑與周袑分候選。王賁不按熟知秦將同名接人。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-062-huzong:line026","text":"乾坤肇立，三才是生。狼弧垂象，實惟兵精；聖人觀法，是效是營，始作器械，爰求厥成。黃、農創代，拓定皇基，上順天心，下息民災。高辛誅共，舜征有苗，啟有甘師，湯有鳴條。周之牧野，漢之垓下，靡不由兵，克定厥緒。明明大吳，實天生德，神武是經，惟皇之極。乃自在昔，黃、虞是祖，越歷五代，繼世在下。應期受命，發跡南土，將恢大繇，革我區夏。乃律天時，制為神軍，取象太一，五將三門；疾則如電，遲則如雲，進止有度，約而不煩。四靈既布，黃龍處中，周制日月，實曰太常，桀然特立，六軍所望。仙人在上，鑒觀四方，神實使之，為國休祥。軍欲轉向，黃龍先移，金鼓不鳴，寂然變施，暗謨若神，可謂秘奇。在昔周室，赤烏銜書，今也大吳，黃龍吐符。合契河洛，動與道俱，天贊人和，歛曰惟休。","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-062-huzong:line026:m0040","surface":"黃","start":40,"end":41,"kind":"person","person_id":"8jz_o3s_obt","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本段具名及前後親稱、官職定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-062-huzong:line026:m0042","surface":"農","start":42,"end":43,"kind":"person","person_id":"0rm_hvx_4a6","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本段具名及前後親稱、官職定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-062-huzong:line026:m0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"高辛","kind":"person","person_id":"9qr_quf_02m","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-062-huzong:line026:m0066","start":66,"end":67,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-062-huzong:line026:m0071","start":71,"end":72,"surface":"啟","kind":"person","person_id":"t4u_no9_s1q","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-062-huzong:line026:m0076","start":76,"end":77,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"tpz_x3m_e0h","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"}],"annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":26,"last_lin