而滅。然則反古未可非，而循禮未足多也。且服奇者志淫，則是鄒、魯無奇行也；俗辟者民易，則是吳、越無秀士也。且聖人利身謂之服，便事謂之禮。夫進退之節，衣服之制者，所以齊常民也，非所以論賢者也。故齊民與俗流，賢者與變倶。故諺曰『以書御者不盡馬之情，以古制今者不達事之變』。循法之功，不足以髙世；法古之學，不足以制今。子不及也。」遂胡服招騎射。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m071-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"趙文","kind":"person","person_id":"ue1_qha_ehn","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m071-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"趙造","kind":"person","person_id":"bfv_clh_n6y","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m071-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"周袑","kind":"person","person_id":"0q2_ioh_psy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m071-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"趙俊","kind":"person","person_id":"ybw_y4h_z69","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m071-0014","start":14,"end":15,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"txj_z8z_5me_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m071-0024","start":24,"end":25,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"txj_z8z_5me_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m071-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"先王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"先王泛稱，不連當前武靈王。"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m071-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"帝王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、代詞、未名君主或版本疑字保留；不把帝王泛稱、父子群體與未決分封當已確證身份或任期。"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m071-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"虙戲","kind":"person","person_id":"xop_byp_p7d","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m071-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"神農","kind":"person","person_id":"0rm_hvx_4a6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m071-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"黃帝","kind":"person","person_id":"mnl_vz0_79n","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m071-0063","start":63,"end":64,"surface":"堯","kind":"person